t-hand side of our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed: \n\n$$\n{C}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 15 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-365983/field-1" "q-365983/field-2" "q-365983/field-3" "q-365983/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e3b2ce-2bd8-5f18-a042-cf37e8560378"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-365983"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
